OL,3,GNEWSALeeds Festival 2026: What you need
OL,4,Ato know
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds Festival will return this
OL,7,Fweekend, with around 90,000
OL,8,Ffestivalgoers set to descend on the
OL,9,FBramham Park site.
OL,11,FNow in its 27th year, the festival -
OL,12,Fwhich is paired with Reading - will be
OL,13,Fheadlined by Charli XCX, Chase &
OL,14,FStatus, Dave, Florence + The Machine,
OL,15,FFontaines D.C., Raye and Kasabian.
OL,17,FWith more than 120 acts appearing
OL,18,Facross seven stages, the event runs
OL,19,Ffrom Thursday 27 to Sunday 30 August.
OL,21,FHere is everything you need to know
OL,22,Fabout what to expect.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
